{
    "title": "Bowling Club: Realistic 3D PvP",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfb3 Bowling Champions aren\u2019t born, they are made in the fire of competition.\ud83c\udfb3 \r\n\r\n\u201cBowling Club\u201d opens up its gates! Step into virtual alleys and experience the thrill of live matchmaking, skillful ball rolling and competitive pin-smashing simulation like never before!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6Best of Both Worlds\r\nBeauty and skill? Yes, please! Now, that\u2019s a game loaded with beautiful content: from superbly designed Arenas, to a slew of equipment, to the player avatars - the eye-catching elements will make you marvel. At the same time, the game is focused on the skill you will master with intuitively easy-to-use controls. No fuss, just fun!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8High-end 3D graphics\r\nWithout question, Bowling Club is gorgeous with its balls rolling ablaze and the funny pin smashing animations. However, unlike competition, our game offers fully customizable 3D avatars! You\u2019re getting a unique opportunity to express yourselves with customization: get your 3D avatar the coolest gear and stand out from the crowd!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaeGame On, Anytime\r\nIt\u2019s perfect for passing the time while waiting or on-the-go. The multiplayer matches don\u2019t take long and the enjoyment never drops in this fast-paced sport!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0dReal Multiplayer Madness\r\nOur game is the real deal. Challenge players from across the globe in thrilling PvP matches, or gather your friends to form a club and dominate the lanes together! With real-time multiplayer action, this competitive simulation never stops.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd47Competitive Edge\r\nThere are multiple challenges you may set for yourself and your crew. Similarly to the real-life sport, there are leaderboards to climb for individual players and clubs. The ranked seasons and the battle pass are intertwined and go along with each other. You\u2019ll never get tired as there\u2019s always a prize to set your eyes on!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf36\ufe0fThe Spice\r\nThe secret sauce to Bowling Club are Special Events and Skillshot. The former ones offer various game modes so that you never get bored and the latter one is exactly as the name advertises: rolling the ball so skillfully that you knock down the most pins possible. There are plenty of rewards just waiting to be won! And if that wasn\u2019t enough, we\u2019ve got the Lucky Wheel: a game of chance where you can get awesome prizes!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc8Quest for Growth\r\nYou will most certainly feel how satisfying it is to level up, unlock new bowling alleys, and conquer the leagues and divisions. You will unlock achievements and get rewards along the way. The healthy diet of daily missions and weekly challenges will keep you motivated. With the multiplayer bouts fought, your gear upgraded, and practice under your belt, the bowling king mastery is for the taking!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd1dJoin our Player Community on social media and share your accolades with fellow pin-smashing enthusiasts! Let the ball roll! Let\u2019s strike up some fun together!\r\n\r\nDiscord: https://bit.ly/ClubGamesOnDiscord\r\n\r\nFB: https://www.facebook.com/BowlingClubOfficial\r\n\r\nIG: https://www.instagram.com/_club_games_/\r\n\r\nTT: https://bit.ly/ClubGamesOnTikTok\r\n\r\nReady to roll? Download Bowling Club now and unleash your inner bowling champion!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfb3 Bowling Champions aren\u2019t born, they are made in the fire of competition.\ud83c\udfb3 <br><br>\u201cBowling Club\u201d opens up its gates! Step into virtual alleys and experience the thrill of live matchmaking, skillful ball rolling and competitive pin-smashing simulation like never before!<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6Best of Both Worlds<br>Beauty and skill? Yes, please! Now, that\u2019s a game loaded with beautiful content: from superbly designed Arenas, to a slew of equipment, to the player avatars - the eye-catching elements will make you marvel. At the same time, the game is focused on the skill you will master with intuitively easy-to-use controls. No fuss, just fun!<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8High-end 3D graphics<br>Without question, Bowling Club is gorgeous with its balls rolling ablaze and the funny pin smashing animations. However, unlike competition, our game offers fully customizable 3D avatars! You\u2019re getting a unique opportunity to express yourselves with customization: get your 3D avatar the coolest gear and stand out from the crowd!<br><br>\ud83c\udfaeGame On, Anytime<br>It\u2019s perfect for passing the time while waiting or on-the-go. The multiplayer matches don\u2019t take long and the enjoyment never drops in this fast-paced sport!<br><br>\ud83c\udf0dReal Multiplayer Madness<br>Our game is the real deal. Challenge players from across the globe in thrilling PvP matches, or gather your friends to form a club and dominate the lanes together! With real-time multiplayer action, this competitive simulation never stops.<br><br>\ud83e\udd47Competitive Edge<br>There are multiple challenges you may set for yourself and your crew. Similarly to the real-life sport, there are leaderboards to climb for individual players and clubs. The ranked seasons and the battle pass are intertwined and go along with each other. You\u2019ll never get tired as there\u2019s always a prize to set your eyes on!<br><br>\ud83c\udf36\ufe0fThe Spice<br>The secret sauce to Bowling Club are Special Events and Skillshot. The former ones offer various game modes so that you never get bored and the latter one is exactly as the name advertises: rolling the ball so skillfully that you knock down the most pins possible. There are plenty of rewards just waiting to be won! And if that wasn\u2019t enough, we\u2019ve got the Lucky Wheel: a game of chance where you can get awesome prizes!<br><br>\ud83d\udcc8Quest for Growth<br>You will most certainly feel how satisfying it is to level up, unlock new bowling alleys, and conquer the leagues and divisions. You will unlock achievements and get rewards along the way. The healthy diet of daily missions and weekly challenges will keep you motivated. With the multiplayer bouts fought, your gear upgraded, and practice under your belt, the bowling king mastery is for the taking!<br><br>\ud83e\udd1dJoin our Player Community on social media and share your accolades with fellow pin-smashing enthusiasts! Let the ball roll! Let\u2019s strike up some fun together!<br><br>Discord: https://bit.ly/ClubGamesOnDiscord<br><br>FB: https://www.facebook.com/BowlingClubOfficial<br><br>IG: https://www.instagram.com/_club_games_/<br><br>TT: https://bit.ly/ClubGamesOnTikTok<br><br>Ready to roll? Download Bowling Club now and unleash your inner bowling champion!",
